Z||000005||isthiswhereiputausername?||05-25-2001||09:54 PM||||If you want it only for web viewing.. Sonic Foundrys stream anywhere will convert it to a asf (you have control over size/quality) and have a few templates built in to allow you to publish the web movie (does the basic html also) <BR> <A HREF="http://www.sonicfoundry.com/products/NewShowProduct.asp?PID=122" TARGET=_blank>http://www.sonicfoundry.com/products/NewShowProduct.asp?PID=122</A> <P>And if this looks like what you need, Im sure that is a full version kicking around somewhere close for you to test to see if its what you need  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>||||reg||1
